      "writtenOn": "2023-09-12T16:51:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think it is rare we\u0027d want an empty alloc at all. There are Vulkan APIs that need the alloc information and not just the VkImage (e.g. I know to query memory layout for uploading to a linear texture). But maybe it is small enough that we would be able to validate correctly when I client should have given us a valid Alloc or not.\n\nFor now I think it is better to just require one is passed in and if needed special case the times where we could have an empty one.",
      "parentUuid": "097d614e_62b6369e",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 75,
        "startChar": 19,
