      "writtenOn": "2023-09-12T16:55:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, the only instances currently that we pass in an empty one are for unit tests and the viewer window context where, internal to skia, we create BackendTextures through ctors directly w/ a premade VkImage as opposed to going through recorder-\u003ecreateBackendTexture() to generate a backend VkImage. I would imagine we expect most external clients to go through the recorder call, but I could be wrong on that.",
